  "content": "<h2>AI in software-engineering</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>AI-paarprogrammering:</strong> Tools zoals GitHub Copilot en GPT-5 versnellen het schrijven, beoordelen en detecteren van fouten.</li>\n<li><strong>Geautomatiseerd testen:</strong> AI genereert en voert unit-/integratietests uit, waardoor de dekking en betrouwbaarheid worden verbeterd.</li>\n<li><strong>Code refactoring:</strong> Machine learning-modellen suggereren een optimale codestructuur en prestatieverbeteringen.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Stap voor stap: AI integreren in uw ontwikkelaarsworkflow</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Installeer AI-aangedreven IDE-extensies (bijvoorbeeld Copilot, Tabnine).</li>\n<li>Configureer uw CI/CD-pijplijn om AI te gebruiken voor het genereren van tests en codebeoordeling.</li>\n<li>Bewaak codekwaliteitsstatistieken met AI-dashboards.</li>\n</ol>\n<div style=\"margin: 2rem 0; text-align: center;\"><svg font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" height=\"400\" viewbox=\"0 0 800 400\" width=\"800\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><defs><marker id=\"a6a\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"10\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#7C4DFF\"></path></marker></defs><rect fill=\"#EDE7F6\" height=\"400\" rx=\"12\" width=\"800\"></rect><text fill=\"#4527A0\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"400\" y=\"42\">AI-aangedreven SDLC</text><rect fill=\"#FFF\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#7C4DFF\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"110\" x=\"25\" y=\"140\"></rect><text fill=\"#4527A0\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"80\" y=\"170\">Vereisten</text><text fill=\"#666\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"80\" y=\"190\">Bijeenkomst</text><rect fill=\"#FFF\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#7C4DFF\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"100\" x=\"160\" y=\"140\"></rect><text fill=\"#4527A0\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"210\" y=\"172\">Ontwerp</text><text fill=\"#666\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"210\" y=\"190\">Architectuur</text><rect fill=\"#7C4DFF\" height=\"80\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#4527A0\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"100\" x=\"285\" y=\"130\"></rect><text fill=\"#FFF\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"335\" y=\"165\">Code</text><text fill=\"#EDE7F6\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"335\" y=\"185\">AI-geassisteerd</text><rect fill=\"#7C4DFF\" height=\"80\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#4527A0\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"100\" x=\"410\" y=\"130\"></rect><text fill=\"#FFF\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"460\" y=\"165\">Test</text><text fill=\"#EDE7F6\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"460\" y=\"185\">AI-gegenereerd</text><rect fill=\"#7C4DFF\" height=\"80\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#4527A0\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"100\" x=\"535\" y=\"130\"></rect><text fill=\"#FFF\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"585\" y=\"165\">Aanwenden</text><text fill=\"#EDE7F6\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"585\" y=\"185\">AI-geoptimaliseerd</text><rect fill=\"#7C4DFF\" height=\"80\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#4527A0\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"115\" x=\"660\" y=\"130\"></rect><text fill=\"#FFF\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"717\" y=\"165\">Monitor</text><text fill=\"#EDE7F6\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"717\" y=\"185\">AI-aangedreven</text><line marker-end=\"url(#a6a)\" stroke=\"#7C4DFF\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"135\" x2=\"160\" y1=\"175\" y2=\"175\"></line><line marker-end=\"url(#a6a)\" stroke=\"#7C4DFF\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"260\" x2=\"285\" y1=\"175\" y2=\"175\"></line><line marker-end=\"url(#a6a)\" stroke=\"#7C4DFF\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"385\" x2=\"410\" y1=\"175\" y2=\"175\"></line><line marker-end=\"url(#a6a)\" stroke=\"#7C4DFF\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"510\" x2=\"535\" y1=\"175\" y2=\"175\"></line><line marker-end=\"url(#a6a)\" stroke=\"#7C4DFF\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"635\" x2=\"660\" y1=\"175\" y2=\"175\"></line><circle cx=\"335\" cy=\"115\" fill=\"#EDE7F6\" r=\"14\" stroke=\"#7C4DFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></circle><text fill=\"#7C4DFF\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"335\" y=\"120\">AI</text><circle cx=\"460\" cy=\"115\" fill=\"#EDE7F6\" r=\"14\" stroke=\"#7C4DFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></circle><text fill=\"#7C4DFF\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"460\" y=\"120\">AI</text><circle cx=\"585\" cy=\"115\" fill=\"#EDE7F6\" r=\"14\" stroke=\"#7C4DFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></circle><text fill=\"#7C4DFF\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"585\" y=\"120\">AI</text><circle cx=\"717\" cy=\"115\" fill=\"#EDE7F6\" r=\"14\" stroke=\"#7C4DFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></circle><text fill=\"#7C4DFF\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"717\" y=\"120\">AI</text><rect fill=\"#D1C4E9\" height=\"50\" opacity=\"0.5\" rx=\"10\" width=\"600\" x=\"100\" y=\"260\"></rect><text fill=\"#4527A0\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"400\" y=\"282\">AI vergroot elke fase van de levenscyclus van softwareontwikkeling</text><text fill=\"#666\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"400\" y=\"300\">Van codegeneratie tot productiemonitoring</text><path d=\"M740 210 Q790 320 400 340 Q10 320 60 210\" fill=\"none\" marker-end=\"url(#a6a)\" stroke=\"#7C4DFF\" stroke-dasharray=\"6,3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></div><h3>Diagram: AI-aangedreven DevOps-pijplijn</h3>\n<img alt=\"AI DevOps-pijplijndiagram\" src=\"/img/ai-programming-code.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;margin:2em 0;\"/>\n<h2>AI in bedrijfsautomatisering</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Intelligente procesautomatisering:</strong> AI-agenten automatiseren repetitieve taken, goedkeuringen en rapportage.</li>\n<li><strong>AI-chatbots:</strong> Automatiseer klantenondersteuning en leadkwalificatie.</li>\n<li><strong>Voorspellende analyses:</strong> AI voorspelt omzet, vraag en klantenverloop.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Stap voor stap: AI-agents inzetten voor automatisering</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Identificeer bedrijfsprocessen die geschikt zijn voor automatisering.</li>\n<li>Kies een AI-platform (UiPath, Automation Anywhere, aangepaste agenten).</li>\n<li>Integreer met uw CRM-, ERP- of ondersteuningssystemen.</li>\n<li>Bewaak en optimaliseer de prestaties van agenten.</li>\n</ol>\n<div style=\"margin: 2rem 0; text-align: center;\"><svg font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" height=\"400\" viewbox=\"0 0 800 400\" width=\"800\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect fill=\"#EDE7F6\" height=\"400\" rx=\"12\" width=\"800\"></rect><text fill=\"#4527A0\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"400\" y=\"42\">Productiviteit van ontwikkelaars: traditioneel versus AI-ondersteund</text><text fill=\"#4527A0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"90\" y=\"90\">Traditioneel</text><rect fill=\"#BDBDBD\" height=\"35\" rx=\"6\" width=\"120\" x=\"170\" y=\"75\"></rect><text fill=\"#333\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"230\" y=\"97\">Vereisten</text><rect fill=\"#BDBDBD\" height=\"35\" rx=\"6\" width=\"100\" x=\"295\" y=\"75\"></rect><text fill=\"#333\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"345\" y=\"97\">Ontwerp</text><rect fill=\"#BDBDBD\" height=\"35\" rx=\"6\" width=\"130\" x=\"400\" y=\"75\"></rect><text fill=\"#333\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"465\" y=\"97\">Ontwikkeling</text><rect fill=\"#BDBDBD\" height=\"35\" rx=\"6\" width=\"80\" x=\"535\" y=\"75\"></rect><text fill=\"#333\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"575\" y=\"97\">Testen</text><rect fill=\"#BDBDBD\" height=\"35\" rx=\"6\" width=\"70\" x=\"620\" y=\"75\"></rect><text fill=\"#333\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"655\" y=\"97\">Aanwenden</text><rect fill=\"#BDBDBD\" height=\"35\" rx=\"6\" width=\"80\" x=\"695\" y=\"75\"></rect><text fill=\"#333\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"735\" y=\"97\">Monitor</text><text fill=\"#4527A0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"90\" y=\"170\">AI-geassisteerd</text><rect fill=\"#B39DDB\" height=\"35\" rx=\"6\" width=\"90\" x=\"170\" y=\"155\"></rect><text fill=\"#FFF\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"215\" y=\"177\">Vereist</text><rect fill=\"#B39DDB\" height=\"35\" rx=\"6\" width=\"70\" x=\"265\" y=\"155\"></rect><text fill=\"#FFF\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"300\" y=\"177\">Ontwerp</text><rect fill=\"#7C4DFF\" height=\"35\" rx=\"6\" width=\"80\" x=\"340\" y=\"155\"></rect><text fill=\"#FFF\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"380\" y=\"177\">Ontwikkelaar (AI)</text><rect fill=\"#7C4DFF\" height=\"35\" rx=\"6\" width=\"55\" x=\"425\" y=\"155\"></rect><text fill=\"#FFF\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"452\" y=\"177\">Test</text><rect fill=\"#7C4DFF\" height=\"35\" rx=\"6\" width=\"50\" x=\"485\" y=\"155\"></rect><text fill=\"#FFF\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"510\" y=\"177\">Aanwenden</text><rect fill=\"#7C4DFF\" height=\"35\" rx=\"6\" width=\"60\" x=\"540\" y=\"155\"></rect><text fill=\"#FFF\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"570\" y=\"177\">Monitor</text><text fill=\"#999\" font-size=\"10\" x=\"170\" y=\"135\">|</text><text fill=\"#7C4DFF\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"605\" y=\"175\">~ 40% sneller</text><path d=\"M690 113 L590 155\" marker-end=\"url(#a6a2)\" stroke=\"#7C4DFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path><path d=\"M535 113 L485 155\" stroke=\"#7C4DFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path><defs><marker id=\"a6a2\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"10\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#7C4DFF\"></path></marker></defs><text fill=\"#4527A0\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"400\" y=\"232\">Belangrijkste verbeteringen met AI</text><rect fill=\"#FFF\" height=\"55\" rx=\"8\" stroke=\"#7C4DFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" width=\"155\" x=\"60\" y=\"250\"></rect><text fill=\"#7C4DFF\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"137\" y=\"275\">10x</text><text fill=\"#666\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"137\" y=\"295\">Codegeneratie</text><rect fill=\"#FFF\" height=\"55\" rx=\"8\" stroke=\"#7C4DFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" width=\"155\" x=\"240\" y=\"250\"></rect><text fill=\"#7C4DFF\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"317\" y=\"275\">60%</text><text fill=\"#666\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"317\" y=\"295\">Sneller testen</text><rect fill=\"#FFF\" height=\"55\" rx=\"8\" stroke=\"#7C4DFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" width=\"155\" x=\"420\" y=\"250\"></rect><text fill=\"#7C4DFF\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"497\" y=\"275\">90%</text><text fill=\"#666\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"497\" y=\"295\">Automatische implementatie</text><rect fill=\"#FFF\" height=\"55\" rx=\"8\" stroke=\"#7C4DFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" width=\"155\" x=\"600\" y=\"250\"></rect><text fill=\"#7C4DFF\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"677\" y=\"275\">24/7</text><text fill=\"#666\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"677\" y=\"295\">AI-monitoring</text><rect fill=\"#D1C4E9\" height=\"35\" opacity=\"0.4\" rx=\"8\" width=\"600\" x=\"100\" y=\"330\"></rect><text fill=\"#4527A0\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"400\" y=\"352\">AI comprimeert tijdlijnen en versterkt de output van ontwikkelaars in elke fase</text></svg></div><h3>Diagram: AI-werkstroom voor bedrijfsautomatisering</h3>\n<img alt=\"AI-bedrijfsautomatiseringsdiagram\" src=\"/img/ai-robot-hand.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;margin:2em 0;\"/>\n<h2>AI in cyberbeveiliging</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Bedreigingsdetectie:</strong> AI-modellen analyseren netwerkverkeer en logboeken om afwijkingen en aanvallen te detecteren.</li>\n<li><strong>Geautomatiseerde respons op incidenten:</strong> AI-agenten beoordelen waarschuwingen en voeren draaiboeken uit voor snelle beheersing.</li>\n<li><strong>Beveiligingsanalyse:</strong> AI correleert gegevens uit meerdere bronnen voor realtime risicobeoordeling.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Stap voor stap: AI gebruiken voor bedreigingsdetectie</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Implementeer AI-aangedreven SIEM-oplossingen (bijvoorbeeld Splunk, IBM QRadar).</li>\n<li>Train modellen op basis van historische aanvalsgegevens.</li>\n<li>Stel geautomatiseerde waarschuwings- en reactieworkflows in.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Diagram: AI-beveiligingsmonitoring</h3>\n<img alt=\"AI-beveiligingsmonitoringdiagram\" src=\"/img/security-monitoring.svg\" style=\"max-width:100%;margin:2em 0;\"/>\n<h3>Belangrijkste krantenkoppen (2025)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Microsoft lanceert Copilot voor Enterprise DevOps:</strong> AI-gestuurde automatisering voor code, infrastructuur en beveiliging.</li>\n<li><strong>IBM WatsonX-beveiligingssuite:</strong> Nieuw platform voor AI-aangedreven detectie en respons op bedreigingen.</li>\n<li><strong>UiPath AI-agenten:</strong> Automatiseer bedrijfsprocessen op het gebied van financiën, HR en IT.</li>\n<li><strong>OpenAI GPT-5 ondersteunt de volgende generatie tools voor codebeoordeling.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Beste YouTube-video's</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2ePf9rue1Ao\" target=\"_blank\">Hoe AI software-engineering transformeert</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QJ4fOD6xF6A\" target=\"_blank\">AI in bedrijfsautomatisering uitgelegd</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KqvK5K3nR6A\" target=\"_blank\">AI voor cyberbeveiliging: detectie en reactie op bedreigingen</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Extra bronnen</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/business/solutions/copilot-for-security\" target=\"_blank\">Microsoft Copilot voor beveiliging</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.uipath.com/solutions/ai\" target=\"_blank\">UiPath AI-oplossingen</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.ibm.com/products/watsonx-security\" target=\"_blank\">IBM WatsonX-beveiliging</a></li>\n</ul>",
